# __SPOTKIT_DISPLAY_NAME__ endpoint function

This optional HubSpot-hosted endpoint is available only to private static apps
with the required HubSpot subscription. It exposes `GET /api/spotkit-example`
inside HubSpot's app-function environment.

Keep execution short, declare every secret in `secretKeys`, validate all request
input, and never treat the endpoint as a replacement for the portable SpotKit
runtime when marketplace distribution is required.
